grades are important.

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:18.530
They are direct reflection
most times of your drive

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.710
and work ethic.

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:23.510
But as Delisha mentioned,

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:28.510
there's unconventional ways
to get into that university,

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:31.450
or that school of your dreams.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:34.970
