00:26:32.140 --> 00:26:34.670
because it's perceived
as a pragmatic profession

00:26:34.670 --> 00:26:36.440
that you can make a good income,

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:38.840
versus something that you're
like, but my heart is there,

00:26:38.840 --> 00:26:40.130
how do you navigate that?

00:26:40.130 --> 00:26:40.963
Because at the end of the day,

00:26:40.963 --> 00:26:43.110
you do have to pay the bills
and you do have to find a job,

00:26:43.110 --> 00:26:45.380
but at the same time, you don't
