build on those passion projects,

00:31:59.470 --> 00:32:02.090
start training after work,

00:32:02.090 --> 00:32:04.420
start building out different projects,

00:32:04.420 --> 00:32:07.320
whether it's an art project or
whether it's a coding project

00:32:07.320 --> 00:32:08.950
and you're learning how to code,

